  "details": "If you want to collect more feedback from users, ingame surveys might be a good idea.\n\nEscape from Tarkov has been doing it for some time and they are collecting some good feedback:\n\nhttps://www.escapefromtarkov.com/news/id/326\n\nhttps://www.escapefromtarkov.com/news/id/335\n\nI would presume you will reach more people this way, than reaching out to users via email or discord servers.\n\nAlso the data can be formatted the way you need it, you can have users ID, time when opened, time when submitted, platform, and other data. You also don't have to work with google forms data format etc.",
